OL,3,CSolar Eclipse 2026: Your guide to
OL,4,Cwatching it in the South West
OL,6,FPeople across our region will have the
OL,7,Fchance to experience a partial solar
OL,8,Feclipse tomorrow, a celestial event
OL,9,Fwhere the Sun will almost be blocked
OL,10,Fout by the Moon.
OL,12,FIt will be the biggest coverage since
OL,13,Fthe total eclipse, back in August
OL,14,F1999, which was total from most of
OL,15,FCornwall and Devon.
OL,17,FThis time around, again, people in
OL,18,FDevon and Cornwall are likely to see
OL,19,Fthe most coverage. People in parts of
OL,20,FGreenland, Iceland and northern Spain
OL,21,Fwill be seeing a total eclipse.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
