OL,3,CSolar Eclipse 2026: Your guide to
OL,4,Cwatching it in the South West
OL,6,FWhat is a solar eclipse and when will
OL,7,Fit happen?
OL,9,FA solar eclipse occurs when the Earth,
OL,10,FMoon and Sun align. The Moon passes in
OL,11,Ffront of the Sun and blocks its light,
OL,12,Fcasting a small shadow on Earth.
OL,14,FTomorrow, the Moon will move slowly in
OL,15,Ffront of the Sun, until roughly 90% of
OL,16,Fthe Sun is covered.
OL,18,FIn Devon and Cornwall, the eclipse
OL,19,Fwill start at about 6:18pm and peak at
OL,20,F7:15pm and finish at about 8:10pm.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
