OL,3,CSolar Eclipse 2026: Your guide to
OL,4,Cwatching it in the South West
OL,6,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,7,Fhas issued advice on how to view the
OL,8,Feclipse safely, saying that permanent
OL,9,Fdamage can be done within seconds if
OL,10,Fprecautions are not followed.
OL,12,FThey warn that "During an eclipse, the
OL,13,FSun appears dimmer than usual, and
OL,14,Ftherefore, directly looking at the Sun
OL,15,Fwithout the right protection can cause
OL,16,Fpermanent damage to your eyesight.
OL,18,F"Ordinary sunglasses, no matter how
OL,19,Fdark, do not provide adequate
OL,20,Fprotection for viewing a solar
OL,21,Feclipse."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
