OL,3,CSolar Eclipse 2026: Your guide to
OL,4,Cwatching it in the South West
OL,6,FThere are two safe approaches to
OL,7,Fwatching the eclipse:
OL,9,FIf you want to use eclipse glasses or
OL,10,Fhandheld solar viewers, you need to
OL,11,Fmake sure they are genuine eclipse
OL,12,Fglasses with specially designed
OL,13,Ffilters that meet the international
OL,14,Fsafety standard ISO 12312-2:2015(E).
OL,16,FGenuine eclipse glasses are available
OL,17,Ffrom reputable retailers.
OL,19,FThey warn to be cautious of products
OL,20,Fsold online that may not meet this
OL,21,Frequirement.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
